  "correctValue": "2520",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>&nbsp;is known at two different temperatures the activation energy can be calculated as:</p><p>At temperature 1:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><msub><mi>RT</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>At temperature 2:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><msub><mi>RT</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>We can subtract one of these equations from the other:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><msub><mi>RT</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><msub><mi>RT</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>This equation can further simplified to:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Ea</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>305</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Ea</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>305</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>600</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>22</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2519</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>88</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2520</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
